<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $0.50-0.75 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $0.50-0.75 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 to $0.75 higher. Top $59.75 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   230-260 lbs    59.50-59.75</p>
<p>Sows - not established.</p>
</text>
